summary:
  tag_missing: 11 of 15 (c001 c013 c015 c024 c025 c031 c033 c034 c044 c056 c061)
  role_vocab: 4 of 15 (c038 c045 c046 c048); Oracle reader wrong: 0 clear
  pattern_1: trigger filters and conditions are lost (flying filter, attacks you, morbid, becomes tapped, sacrifice Clue, targeted by your spell, face-down, activate only if)
  pattern_2: redirect, retarget, lose-ability and trigger-doubling effects have no tag family
  pattern_3: role names: draw vs card_adv/draw_engine and removal vs answer/interaction differ between readers; add a one-line mapping to the form reminders
  unclear_top: trigger 13, condition 8, target_type 6, cost_mana 4
